# Launcher Path Resilience Patch

**Goal**: Fix the "Path not found" and "Missing package.json" errors by making the directory switching logic more robust across all launchers.

## Proposed Changes

### Launchers (scripts/launchers/)

#### [MODIFY] [LAUNCH_SOVEREIGN_CORE.bat](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/scripts/launchers/LAUNCH_SOVEREIGN_CORE.bat)
- Implement absolute root detection.
- Use `%PROJECT_ROOT%` for all internal commands to avoid relative path drift.

#### [MODIFY] [launch_neural_bridge.bat](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/scripts/launchers/launch_neural_bridge.bat)
- Add root detection to ensure it finds the `swarm` folder correctly.

#### [MODIFY] [launch_iron_brain.bat](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/scripts/launchers/launch_iron_brain.bat)
- Add root detection to ensure it finds the model files.

```batch
:: Robust Root Detection Pattern
set "SCRIPT_DIR=%~dp0"
cd /d "%SCRIPT_DIR%"
cd ..\..
set "PROJECT_ROOT=%CD%"
```

